<%# Plain text: values are output raw, since HTML escaping would show up literally. Name and host only, never the URL. -%>
<% content_for :footer, raw("You're receiving this because you're a member of #{@project.account.name} and #{@project.name} sends uptime alerts.\nMute #{@project.name} uptime alerts: #{@mute_url}\nNotification settings: #{notifications_url}") -%>
<%= raw @monitor.name %> is back up

Good Sorcery reached <%= raw @monitor.host %> again.

App: <%= raw @project.name %>
Monitor: <%= raw @monitor.name %>
Down for: <%= uptime_duration(@incident.duration) %>
From – To: <%= alert_incident_period(@incident) %>
<% if @incident.cause_label -%>
Cause: <%= @incident.cause_label %>
<% end -%>

Open monitor:
<%= @monitor_url %>
